00:19:57.640 --> 00:20:00.330
We needed to expose that
data, both internally

00:20:00.330 --> 00:20:02.760
to other development teams
at Urban Science, as well

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:04.710
as external partners.

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:07.740
Marketing agencies--
if you guys were

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:09.708
