00:23:41.860 --> 00:23:43.030
OK, guys, we can't do this.

00:23:43.030 --> 00:23:44.030
That's terrible.

00:23:44.030 --> 00:23:47.300
We need to know exactly what's
going on inside our systems.

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:49.280
And then we were also guessing.

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:51.613
So we guessed a lot about
what the traffic patterns were

00:23:51.613 --> 00:23:54.030
