scale was going to look like.

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:56.053
We had tools that helped
us understand that.

00:23:56.053 --> 00:23:57.470
But we didn't see
it in real time.

00:23:57.470 --> 00:24:00.370
And API monitoring, when
they released it out

00:24:00.370 --> 00:24:03.030
