00:26:53.030 --> 00:26:54.680
It's basically, five over five.

00:26:54.680 --> 00:26:59.450
So if you've got 5x errors over
five minutes and it repeats,

00:26:59.450 --> 00:27:00.870
you're going to have a problem.

00:27:00.870 --> 00:27:03.500
5x errors over five minutes
that doesn't repeat?

00:27:03.500 --> 00:27:05.620
Latency issue, connectivity
issue, somebody's

00:27:05.620 --> 00:27:08.300
